            <ul>
              <li><i class="ri-check-line"></i> Project scheduling &amp; milestone tracking</li>
              <li><i class="ri-check-line"></i> Budget management &amp; cost control</li>
              <li><i class="ri-check-line"></i> Risk identification &amp; mitigation</li>
              <li><i class="ri-check-line"></i> Contractor &amp; consultant management</li>
              <li><i class="ri-check-line"></i> Quality assurance &amp; compliance</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="#" class="explore-link" style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-size:0.875rem; font-weight:600; color:#003F2D;">
