            <i class="ri-ship-line cap-icon-overlay"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="db-cap-body">
            <div class="tag">Capability</div>
            <h3>Supply Chain Sourcing</h3>
            <p>Strategic procurement and vendor management that reduce costs, mitigate risk, and accelerate project timelines. Our global supplier network gives clients access to pre-vetted, best-in-class vendors at competitive pricing.</p>
            <ul>
              <li><i class="ri-check-line"></i> Strategic vendor selection &amp; management</li>
              <li><i class="ri-check-line"></i> Global procurement network</li>
              <li><i class="ri-check-line"></i> Cost benchmarking &amp; negotiation</li>
              <li><i class="ri-check-line"></i> Supply chain risk management</li>
              <li><i class="ri-check-line"></i> Sustainable sourcing &amp; ESG compliance</li>
